{"about_the_game":"There are tens of thousands of different wonderful platform jumping levels, created by the most talented players all over the world. If you love platform jumping, you can't miss it.<br><br>2D platformer runner game with all levels completed by players, no official maps, and ultra-high freedom.<br><br>Highly customizable, all items are supported to be redrawn in the game.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2991320/extras/07ca577d17cee828f5740d398fb9fb7c.poster.avif?t=1721397921\" width=400 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2991320/extras/07ca577d17cee828f5740d398fb9fb7c.webm?t=1721397921\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2991320/extras/07ca577d17cee828f5740d398fb9fb7c.mp4?t=1721397921\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Custom item function, control monster logic without programming<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2991320/extras/ac7e63af20f0fbce5d053c1477236c72.poster.avif?t=1721397921\" width=400 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2991320/extras/ac7e63af20f0fbce5d053c1477236c72.webm?t=1721397921\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2991320/extras/ac7e63af20f0fbce5d053c1477236c72.mp4?t=1721397921\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Extremely difficult jumping and dodging.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2991320/extras/d5ecb717d9e5734a3691bfcfc68301dd.poster.avif?t=1721397921\" width